<h1>AI Hedge Fund &mdash; Source Code Wiki</h1>
<div class="hero">
  <p class="subtitle">Multi-Agent LLM Trading System</p>
  <p>A comprehensive wiki documenting the AI Hedge Fund source code &mdash; a multi-agent
  trading system that uses large language models to simulate the investment strategies
  of famous investors. Built on LangGraph, it orchestrates 19 analyst agents, a risk
  manager, and a portfolio manager to generate actionable long/short trading decisions
  from real financial data.</p>
</div>

