<h2 id="key-components">Key Components</h2>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Class / Function</th><th>File</th><th>Role</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td><code>run_hedge_fund()</code></td><td><code>main.py</code></td><td>Entry point &mdash; builds the StateGraph and invokes the agent pipeline</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>AgentState</code></td><td><code>graph/state.py</code></td><td>TypedDict defining the shared state passed through every graph node</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>warren_buffett_agent</code></td><td><code>agents/warren_buffett.py</code></td><td>Analyst agent using Buffett&rsquo;s value-investing philosophy</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>ben_graham_agent</code></td><td><code>agents/ben_graham.py</code></td><td>Analyst agent applying Graham&rsquo;s margin-of-safety methodology</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>technical_analyst_agent</code></td><td><code>agents/technical_analyst.py</code></td><td>Computes RSI, MACD, Bollinger Bands and chart pattern signals</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>sentiment_agent</code></td><td><code>agents/sentiment.py</code></td><td>Analyzes news sentiment, social media, and insider trading patterns</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>risk_manager_agent</code></td><td><code>agents/risk_manager.py</code></td><td>Evaluates aggregate signals against portfolio risk constraints</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>portfolio_manager_agent</code></td><td><code>agents/portfolio_manager.py</code></td><td>Makes final buy/sell/short decisions and position sizing</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>get_prices()</code></td><td><code>tools/api.py</code></td><td>Fetches OHLCV price data from financial APIs</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>get_financial_metrics()</code></td><td><code>tools/api.py</code></td><td>Retrieves balance sheets, income statements, and ratios</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>get_insider_trades()</code></td><td><code>tools/api.py</code></td><td>Fetches SEC insider trading filings for a ticker</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>Backtester</code></td><td><code>backtester.py</code></td><td>Replays strategies over historical periods, computes performance metrics</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>get_model()</code></td><td><code>llm/models.py</code></td><td>Factory returning the configured LLM (OpenAI, Anthropic, Groq, etc.)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>create_graph()</code></td><td><code>graph/graph.py</code></td><td>Constructs the LangGraph StateGraph with all nodes and edges</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>display_decisions()</code></td><td><code>utils/display.py</code></td><td>Formats and prints trading decisions as a rich console table</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

