<h2 id="sub-modules">Sub-Modules</h2>
<div class="card-grid">
  <a title="Agents — AI Investment Analysts | AI Hedge Fund Wiki" class="card" href="agents/index.html">
    <h4>agents/</h4>
    <p>19 analyst agents + risk manager + portfolio manager. Each agent embodies a
    distinct investment philosophy.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Famous investor agents (Buffett, Munger, Graham, Taleb&hellip;)</li>
      <li>Analytical agents (technical, fundamental, sentiment, valuation)</li>
      <li>~4,200 lines across 22 files</li>
    </ul>
  </a>
