<h2 id="configuration">Configuration</h2>
<p>Key configuration knobs controlling the system behavior:</p>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Location</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td><code>--model</code></td><td>CLI / env</td><td><code>gpt-4o</code></td><td>LLM model to use for all agents</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>--model-provider</code></td><td>CLI / env</td><td><code>openai</code></td><td>LLM provider (openai, anthropic, groq, gemini, ollama&hellip;)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>OPENAI_API_KEY</code></td><td><code>.env</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>OpenAI API key for GPT models</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>ANTHROPIC_API_KEY</code></td><td><code>.env</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Anthropic API key for Claude models</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>FINANCIAL_DATASETS_API_KEY</code></td><td><code>.env</code></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Financial Modeling Prep API key for market data</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>--tickers</code></td><td>CLI</td><td><code>AAPL,MSFT,NVDA</code></td><td>Comma-separated list of stock tickers to analyze</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>--start-date</code></td><td>CLI</td><td>3 months ago</td><td>Start of analysis date range (YYYY-MM-DD)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>--end-date</code></td><td>CLI</td><td>today</td><td>End of analysis date range (YYYY-MM-DD)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>--initial-cash</code></td><td>CLI</td><td><code>100000</code></td><td>Starting portfolio cash balance in USD</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>--margin-requirement</code></td><td>CLI</td><td><code>0.0</code></td><td>Margin requirement for short positions (0.0&ndash;1.0)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>--analysts</code></td><td>CLI</td><td>all</td><td>Comma-separated list of analyst agents to include</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>--max-position-pct</code></td><td>Risk config</td><td><code>0.25</code></td><td>Max portfolio percentage for a single position</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>--show-reasoning</code></td><td>CLI</td><td><code>false</code></td><td>Display detailed agent reasoning in output</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>--backtest</code></td><td>CLI</td><td><code>false</code></td><td>Run in backtesting mode instead of single analysis</td></tr>
